    <h1>Best USB-C Accessories for Laptops</h1>

    <p>
      USB-C has become one of the most useful connections on modern laptops.
      With the right accessories, one small port can connect displays, storage,
      chargers, keyboards, mice and many other devices.
    </p>

    <p>
      This guide explains the most useful USB-C accessories and what to look
      for before buying them.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Last updated: October 2026</strong></p>

  </div>
</section>


